BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Transfer planning: a flight by Venus to Mars</h1>
A delta-glider in a 300 km Earth orbit in August 2023. The script plans
the route to a 500 km Mars orbit by a Venus flyby, arms its nodes and flies
them with the burn autopilot: the ejection, the correction after the flyby
and the others computed shortly before they are due, the capture; then it
checks the Venus flyby and the Mars orbit.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 60196.0
  Script Tests/RouteFlightTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship GL-F
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET GL-F
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
GL-F:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting Earth
  ELEMENTS 6671000.0 0.00000 28.5 0.0 0.0 0.0 60196.0
  AROT 0 0 0
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
